<title>FINLAND: FINNISH COMPANIES' INTERIM RESULTS AND FORECASTS.</title>
<headline>FINNISH COMPANIES' INTERIM RESULTS AND FORECASTS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' forecasts for Finnish</p>
<p>companies' latest interim results, and published earnings:</p>
<p>For most companies, figures are profit after financial</p>
<p>items, before extraordinary items and tax (for Nokia, profit</p>
<p>before tax and minorities).</p>
<p>For banks, figures are operating profit after credit losses.</p>
<p>The list will be updated as reports and forecasts are</p>
<p>published.</p>
<p>(all figures million markka)</p>
<p>THREE-MONTH RESULTS (to end-March)</p>
<p>	     Median forecast   Result	Range	 Result date</p>
<p> Nokia	  1,260	     1,452   1,027-1,540	  29/4</p>
<p> TT Tieto	  56		  60.4    44-61		6/5</p>
<p> Rauma	    155		 158     131-260	     6/5</p>
<p> Merita	   431		 934     280-539	     7/5</p>
<p> Fiskars	   50		  59	43-77		7/5</p>
<p> Metsaserla	20		 129 loss 50-170 profit   12/5</p>
<p> UPM-Kymmene  1,350	     1,345     952-1,580	  15/5</p>
<p> Enso	     351		 480     258-470	    20/5</p>
<p>FOUR-MONTH RESULTS (to end-April)</p>
<p>	     Median forecast   Result	Range	 Result date</p>
<p> Finnlines	 110		132     102-139	    21/5</p>
<p> Cultor	     60		 50	50-75	     28/5</p>
<p> Amer	  loss 53	  loss 49	90-30 (losses)  29/5</p>
<p> Aspo		 34		 33.6    27-42	     29/5</p>
<p> Konecranes	 42		 37.1    30-51	     29/5</p>
<p> Valmet	    358		N/A     310-400	     4/6</p>
<p> Nokian Renkaat   33		N/A	24-37		4/6</p>
<p> Asko		107		N/A	70-173	     5/6</p>
<p> Hartwall	   46.5	    N/A	38-64		5/6</p>
<p> Instrumentarium 116		N/A	73-130	     5/6</p>
<p> Outokumpu	 235		N/A     143-303	     5/6</p>
<p> Kone		 29		N/A	12-48		6/6</p>
<p> Tamfelt	    31		N/A	29-37		5/6</p>
<p> Tamro		71.5	    N/A	65-84		6/6</p>
<p> Vaisala	    36		N/A	31-39		9/9</p>
<p> YIT-Yhtyma	 40		N/A	30-57		9/9</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 292</p>
